---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout>
  <h1>Dashboard API</h1>

  <h2>Endpoints</h2>

  <table class="key-table">
    <tr>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Path</th>
      <th>Permission</th>
      <th>Purpose</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>GET</code></td>
      <td><code>/api/v1/dashboard/summary</code></td>
      <td><code>assessments:view</code></td>
      <td>Portfolio metrics aggregation</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p>Returns vendor counts, average score, RAG distribution, vendor-by-tier counts, top 10 deficient controls, open findings count, and assessment status breakdown. No per-vendor PII — aggregation only.</p>

  <pre><code>{`{
  "vendorCount": 42,
  "averageScore": 0.73,
  "openFindings": 12,
  "scoreDistribution": { "green": 25, "amber": 10, "red": 4, "unscored": 3 },
  "topDeficientControls": [
    { "code": "A.5.29", "title": "Information security during disruption", "vendorCount": 8 }
  ]
}`}</code></pre>
</DocsLayout>
